{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\r\n# Building the Cassandra database\r\n### Ref. '2.4 Cassandra Database Design og Bruk' in report.\r\nThis notebook is created with the intention of beeing a single run document to build the CQL database with keyspaces and tables that fulfill the requirement to complete the assigned CQL related tasks for \"milestone1\" in the project assigment.  \r\nThe first time this document is run the following actions will be executed:  \r\n- Create a keyspace to contain the tables.\r\n- Create tables where the setup corresponds to the following queries:\r\n    • Trips by pickup date (e.g., all trips starting in zone X on day Y).\r\n    • Top drop-off zones for a pickup zone (with counts).\r\n    • Daily revenue per borough.\r\n    • Use clustering columns for sorting by drop-off or fare.\r\n    • Create `trips_by_day_zone`, `daily_revenue_by_borough`, etc.\r\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:10:04+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Building the Cassandra database</h1>\n<h3>Ref. &lsquo;2.4 Cassandra Database Design og Bruk&rsquo; in report.</h3>\n<p>This notebook is created with the intention of beeing a single run document to build the CQL database with keyspaces and tables that fulfill the requirement to complete the assigned CQL related tasks for &ldquo;milestone1&rdquo; in the project assigment.<br />\nThe first time this document is run the following actions will be executed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create a keyspace to contain the tables.</li>\n<li>Create tables where the setup corresponds to the following queries:<br />\n• Trips by pickup date (e.g., all trips starting in zone X on day Y).<br />\n• Top drop-off zones for a pickup zone (with counts).<br />\n• Daily revenue per borough.<br />\n• Use clustering columns for sorting by drop-off or fare.<br />\n• Create <code>trips_by_day_zone</code>, <code>daily_revenue_by_borough</code>, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762121397784_483929721","id":"paragraph_1762121397784_483929721","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T22:09:57+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-02T22:10:04+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-02T22:10:09+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n### Creating the keyspace.\nThis cell creates a keyspace named `tlc_ks` which contains a collection of the custom tables for TLC related querie assignments.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:10:16+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Creating the keyspace.</h3>\n<p>This cell creates a keyspace named <code>tlc_ks</code> which contains a collection of the custom tables for TLC related querie assignments.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762121404814_1645540727","id":"paragraph_1762121404814_1645540727","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T22:10:04+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-02T22:10:14+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-02T22:10:17+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%cassandra\nCREATE KEYSPACE IF NOT EXISTS tlc_ks\nWITH replication = {\n    'class' : 'SimpleStrategy',\n    'replication_factor' : 1\n};","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:10:31+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"text","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":false}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <h5>No Result &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#2c613536-6304-4d8d-b230-3d98f1739db2\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"text-info\"><strong>Last query execution info</strong></span>\n    </a>\n  </h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n  <div id=\"2c613536-6304-4d8d-b230-3d98f1739db2\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-body\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-6 col-offset-md-3 table-responsive table-bordered\">\n          <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Information</th>\n                <th style=\"text-align:left\">Value</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Statement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">CREATE KEYSPACE IF NOT EXISTS tlc_ks\nWITH replication = {\n    'class' : 'SimpleStrategy',\n    'replication_factor' : 1\n};</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Tried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Queried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Schema in Agreement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">true</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762121414935_624384965","id":"paragraph_1762121414935_624384965","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T22:10:14+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-02T22:10:31+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-02T22:10:31+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n## Bulding tables\n### Ref. ‘2.4.1.1 Target queries’ in report.\nThe following cells create the tables which are designed to fit the assigments queries.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:10:49+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Bulding tables</h2>\n<h3>Ref. ‘2.4.1.1 Target queries’ in report.</h3>\n<p>The following cells create the tables which are designed to fit the assigments queries.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762121431417_286920330","id":"paragraph_1762121431417_286920330","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T22:10:31+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-02T22:10:49+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-02T22:10:49+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Trips by pickup date (e.g., all trips starting in zone X on day Y).","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:10:55+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Trips by pickup date (e.g., all trips starting in zone X on day Y).</h4>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762121449161_1125920627","id":"paragraph_1762121449161_1125920627","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T22:10:49+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-02T22:10:55+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-02T22:10:55+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%cassandra\nUSE tlc_ks;\n\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS trips_by_day_zone(\n    pickup_date DATE,\n    pickup_zone TEXT,\n    number_of_trips INT,\n    PRIMARY KEY (pickup_date, pickup_zone)\n);","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:11:06+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"text","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":false}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <h5>No Result &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#c045361b-9e38-4c06-b4fa-7f36d1a60d17\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"text-info\"><strong>Last query execution info</strong></span>\n    </a>\n  </h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n  <div id=\"c045361b-9e38-4c06-b4fa-7f36d1a60d17\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-body\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-6 col-offset-md-3 table-responsive table-bordered\">\n          <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Information</th>\n                <th style=\"text-align:left\">Value</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Statement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS trips_by_day_zone(\n    pickup_date DATE,\n    pickup_zone TEXT,\n    number_of_trips INT,\n    PRIMARY KEY (pickup_date, pickup_zone)\n);</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Tried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Queried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Schema in Agreement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">true</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762121455532_1134799830","id":"paragraph_1762121455532_1134799830","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T22:10:55+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-02T22:11:06+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-02T22:11:06+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Top drop-off zones for a pickup zone (with counts).","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:11:23+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Top drop-off zones for a pickup zone (with counts).</h4>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762121466580_564844696","id":"paragraph_1762121466580_564844696","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T22:11:06+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-02T22:11:23+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-02T22:11:23+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%cassandra\nUSE tlc_ks;\n\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS top_dropoff_zones_by_pickup_zone(\n    pickup_zone TEXT,\n    dropoff_zone TEXT,\n    trips BIGINT,\n    PRIMARY KEY (pickup_zone, trips)\n)WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (trips DESC);","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:11:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <h5>No Result &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#dc67dbb8-2091-4008-b487-ae4f01b8dd5b\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"text-info\"><strong>Last query execution info</strong></span>\n    </a>\n  </h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n  <div id=\"dc67dbb8-2091-4008-b487-ae4f01b8dd5b\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-body\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-6 col-offset-md-3 table-responsive table-bordered\">\n          <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Information</th>\n                <th style=\"text-align:left\">Value</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Statement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS top_dropoff_zones_by_pickup_zone(\n    pickup_zone TEXT,\n    dropoff_zone TEXT,\n    trips BIGINT,\n    PRIMARY KEY (pickup_zone, trips)\n)WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (trips DESC);</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Tried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Queried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Schema in Agreement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">true</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762121495406_889124657","id":"paragraph_1762121495406_889124657","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T22:11:35+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-02T22:11:43+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-02T22:11:43+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Daily revenue per borough.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:12:04+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Daily revenue per borough.</h4>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762121477407_394852762","id":"paragraph_1762121477407_394852762","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T22:11:17+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-02T22:12:04+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-02T22:12:04+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%cassandra\nUSE tlc_ks;\n\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS daily_revenue_by_borough(\n    borough TEXT,\n    day DATE,\n    revenue FLOAT,\n    PRIMARY KEY (borough, day)\n)WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (day ASC);","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:13:18+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"text","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <h5>No Result &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#dc0eb17b-8368-4821-b8b5-7289a740bca1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"text-info\"><strong>Last query execution info</strong></span>\n    </a>\n  </h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n  <div id=\"dc0eb17b-8368-4821-b8b5-7289a740bca1\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-body\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-6 col-offset-md-3 table-responsive table-bordered\">\n          <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Information</th>\n                <th style=\"text-align:left\">Value</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Statement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS daily_revenue_by_borough(\n    borough TEXT,\n    day DATE,\n    revenue FLOAT,\n    PRIMARY KEY (borough, day)\n)WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (day ASC);</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Tried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Queried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Schema in Agreement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">true</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762121524535_1607643009","id":"paragraph_1762121524535_1607643009","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T22:12:04+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-02T22:13:18+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-02T22:13:18+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\r\n### Ref. ‘2.4.1.2 Activity’ in report.\r\n#### Use clustering columns for sorting by drop-off.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-02T22:13:37+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Ref. ‘2.4.1.2 Activity’ in report.</h3>\n<h4>Use clustering columns for sorting by drop-off.</h4>